algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm: enumerateBoundedReducts(d, t)
Input: depth bound d, lambda term t
Output: set of all terms reachable within d steps

visited <- {t}
frontier <- {t}
for step = 1 to d:
    next_frontier <- empty
    for term in frontier:
        for reduct in betaStepAll(term):
            if reduct not in visited:
                visited <- visited + {reduct}
                next_frontier <- next_frontier + {reduct}
    frontier <- next_frontier
return visited

Complexity: O(B^d) time and space where B = max branching factor
